{"steam_appid":4312190,"steam_name":"CRACK","trailer_hls":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/4312190/1101562683/ceeaa81a0d162f25f6c4839b99f2f1d936c62401/1793024565/hls_264_master.m3u8?t=1793032154","trailer_thumb":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257479142/dc85b8adcc23ebb20090e9bb2896a6e4cee53ce7/movie_600x337.jpg?t=1793032154","screenshots":["https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4312190/3bcfacdd8585e15df887b0f4d9afdd1c29ec8496/ss_3bcfacdd8585e15df887b0f4d9afdd1c29ec8496.1920x1080.jpg?t=1793035699","https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4312190/e6cc655bac4741c0a8630752c7ffafc589416296/ss_e6cc655bac4741c0a8630752c7ffafc589416296.1920x1080.jpg?t=1793035699","https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4312190/fafd364a7ae81f2f990544edbb9c443d388d0c23/ss_fafd364a7ae81f2f990544edbb9c443d388d0c23.1920x1080.jpg?t=1793035699","https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4312190/54db64f0575351164c534611312584705f6690c1/ss_54db64f0575351164c534611312584705f6690c1.1920x1080.jpg?t=1793035699","https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4312190/2a8fd0be2b9b2a7fb5484f8bf671f79cf001dd7b/ss_2a8fd0be2b9b2a7fb5484f8bf671f79cf001dd7b.1920x1080.jpg?t=1793035699"],"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4312190/extras/4b50d3e56176a0104031169efc466483.poster.avif?t=1793035699\" width=1170 height=328 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4312190/extras/4b50d3e56176a0104031169efc466483.webm?t=1793035699\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4312190/extras/4b50d3e56176a0104031169efc466483.mp4?t=1793035699\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>CRACK is a 1-4 player co-op adventure where you and your friends work together to uncover what's inside a mysterious giant egg.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4312190/extras/a060bd3b9e498d25f564d449dfa6dffb.webp?t=1793035699\" width=452 height=60 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4312190/extras/6ba4cc9c7baadc6f40699819ed708c35.poster.avif?t=1793035699\" width=1170 height=328 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4312190/extras/6ba4cc9c7baadc6f40699819ed708c35.webm?t=1793035699\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4312190/extras/6ba4cc9c7baadc6f40699819ed708c35.mp4?t=1793035699\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There is an egg.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >It is very big.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your job is simple: crack it open. Don’t ask why.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4312190/extras/567718aae9e13c5c7f0e8506b9252832.webp?t=1793035699\" width=664 height=60 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4312190/extras/6ab18908507f2109b5f3ab293c043245.poster.avif?t=1793035699\" width=1170 height=328 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4312190/extras/6ab18908507f2109b5f3ab293c043245.webm?t=1793035699\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4312190/extras/6ab18908507f2109b5f3ab293c043245.mp4?t=1793035699\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Who built this laboratory?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Why are you here?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unlock hidden rooms and upgrade your tools throughout the facility.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4312190/extras/3e072062d05539bf76f2e5228714b673.webp?t=1793035699\" width=705 height=61 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4312190/extras/6d8a241070ff37db5f16c1a79a3821be.poster.avif?t=1793035699\" width=1170 height=328 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4312190/extras/6d8a241070ff37db5f16c1a79a3821be.webm?t=1793035699\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4312190/extras/6d8a241070ff37db5f16c1a79a3821be.mp4?t=1793035699\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The Egg reacts to you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Listen closely.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Find out what's inside. Whatever happens after that is above your pay grade.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >I’m building CRACK in public from Day 1! Follow the development on social media, and tell me what to develop next.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4312190/extras/3c45de30d77f858a71f54aced1f3decf.avif?t=1793035699\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4312190/extras_big/3c45de30d77f858a71f54aced1f3decf.webp?t=1793035699 width=1560 height=1024 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","requirements_minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system<br></li><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10 64-bit<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel i5-6600 / Ryzen 5 1600<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 8 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> GTX 1050 Ti / RX 570, 4 GB VRAM<br></li><li><strong>DirectX:</strong> Version 11<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 3 GB available space</li></ul>","requirements_recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system<br></li><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10/11 64-bit<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel i5-10400 / Ryzen 5 3600<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 16 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> GTX 1660 Super / RTX 2060 / RX 5600 XT, 6 GB<br></li><li><strong>DirectX:</strong> Version 12<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 3 GB available space</li></ul>","genres":["Adventure","Simulation"],"developers":["Rafoli"],"publishers":["Rafoli"],"release_date":"26 Oct, 2026"}